OL,3,GNEWSAFormer Labour city councillor
OL,4,Ajoins Green Party
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Labour councillor has joined
OL,7,Fthe opposition Green Party group on
OL,8,FLeicester City Council.
OL,10,FDiane Cank was elected as a Labour
OL,11,Fmember for the Troon ward in 2015 but
OL,12,Fquit the party in 2023 when it
OL,13,Fsuspended all members of its Leicester
OL,14,FEast branch in 2023.
OL,16,FCank had been sitting as a member of
OL,17,Fthe local One Leicester party, but said
OL,18,Fjoining the Greens would help her hold
OL,19,Fthe authority's Labour administration
OL,20,Fto account.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
