OL,3,GNEWSAFormer Labour city councillor
OL,4,Ajoins Green Party
OL,5,
OL,6,FLabour city mayor Sir Peter Soulsby
OL,7,Fsaid he believed the Greens would be
OL,8,Fpleased to accept Cank at a time when
OL,9,Fthey were losing support elsewhere.
